docs(standards): add enterprise execution rules to coding standards

- Added Section 9 "Code-Level Execution Rules (Enterprise Pro Max)" to `coding-standards.md`.
- Formalized requirements for Dependency Injection (DI) to decouple Service and Infrastructure layers.
- Established strict Concurrency Safety rules for Rust (no blocking I/O in async, no holding locks across await points).
- Added API Contract Design mandates (Pagination requirement, strict schema versioning).
- Defined Frontend Architecture rules (separation of Business Logic vs UI, prevention of waterfall fetching).
